d a bit  confusing so i'll try to clear it up as  much as possible  basically one for all score retains the  quirk factor  of each previous user and it also  retains some aspect of the user's  consciousness  the previous users themselves are all  dead except for all might of course  but some part of their consciousness  remained  inside one for all these consciousnesses  are what we refer to as  vestiges and they are able to directly  communicate with deku the current  one for all user when certain conditions  are met  now about the quirks before deku no  other one for all user had access to the  previous user's quirks  so for example all might could not use  nana's quirk or any other quirk aside  from one for all itself  but for some reason deku is the first  user who has been able to unlock  the quirk factors of the previous users  which allows them to manifest  their quirks now you might be asking  yourself why is daku  so special the long answer is that one  for all has been getting stronger with  each new user its core has been  expanding  and deku just happens to be the one who  inherited the quirk at a critical time  in its continuing evolution up until  this point one for all was still  changing and growing but now deku is the  first user who has the potential  to truly complete one for all the short  answer  is protagonist powers the first new  quirk that deku is able to activate  is of course black whip this quirk  allows its user to generate black  tendrils from their body and use these  tendrils to either attack an opponent  restrain an opponent or increase the  versatility of the user's  own movements black whip is an extremely  useful quirk  and it appears to be powered by strong  emotions such as anger  this means that the angrier the user  becomes while still maintaining control  of his senses  the stronger the quirk will become but  the user must learn to control  and channel that anger properly by  maintaining a pure heart  otherwise the user could lose control of  the court black whip suddenly activated  inside of deku during the showdown  against  class 1b just as deku thought i'll  capture that guy  while chasing nato monoma this strong  urge to capture monoma that deku  felt in that moment subconsciously  triggered the activation of black whip  because this was the best quirk for that  job  deku was caught off guard by black  whip's sudden activation  and at first he was unable to control it  he needed to work together with ochako  and shinso  in order to restrain the quirk part of  the reason why deku struggled to control  the quirk is the fact that black whip  is much stronger now than it had been  originally black whip is now being  powered by the growing strength of one  for all itself  so it is much stronger now than it was  when it was possessed by its  original user and the same goes for the  other five quirks that deku  is going to manifest and speaking of  those five  other quirks what are they and how do  they work  just like deku all might is quirkless so  deku won't be inheriting a quirk from  him  but almight's former master nana shimura  possessed a quirk  called float which allowed her to  levitate in the air  deku will learn this high flying quirk  in the near future  another quirk that deku will be learning  is smokescreen  which allows its user to expel a thick  cloud of smoke from their body  the smoke can be spread to cover a wide  area  and this serves as a way to obscure the  vision of your opponents  allowing you to hide from them and  either catch them by surprise or simply  escape from them  yet another quirk that deku is going to  manifest is  danger sense which allows its user to  instantly identify  imminent threats in the surrounding area  so it's basically a spidey sense  and then there's fog in a quirk that  allows its user to build up kinetic  energy  in different parts of their body and  then use that energy to release an  explosive burst of speed  and power i'm sure you c